      "Van Buren DHHS ",
      "                           In House Operating Procedures ",
      "                          (I.H.O.P)  ",
      "MDHHS",
      " ",
      " ",
      " ",
      "Subject:  Community Resource Plan, Van Buren County ",
      " ",
      "Date:  7/19/2016 ",
      "  ",
      "Person Responsible: Community Resource Coordinator, Niki Handy, Leesa Haist, ",
      "Program Manager        ",
      "Review Date:  N/A  ",
      "Source:  Practice Spotlight Exercise: Community Resource Plan July 2016. ",
      "Units Affected:  All Staff and Managers ",
      "Training Potential:  All Staff and Managers ",
      "Objective: The purpose procedure is to ensure staff are aware of the services and resources ",
      "available within MDHHS and in the community and that there is a plan to train staff, update the ",
      "resource guide and institute specific engagements with community stakeholders to ensure staff ",
      "are comfortable referring clients or reaching out to solicit additional information on service ",
      "offerings ",
      "Training and Familiarization of Staff with the Community Resource Plan ",
      "Supervisors will present and distribute the Community Partner Resource List to all workers ",
      "during unit meetings. Any employee that misses their unit meeting will receive their Community ",
      "Resource Partner list and any applicable training during their monthly conference with their ",
      "supervisor. The Community Partner Resource List is attached to this procedure and available to ",
      "all staff in the policy folder under Local Office Procedures ",
      "Updating the Community Resource Plan ",
      "The Community Resource Partner List will be updated on an ongoing and as needed basis by ",
      "the Community Resource Coordinator with input from the Supervisors, PAFC Providers, ",
      "Community Agencies and Staff. The list will be completely updated every year no later than ",
      "August. Each September, the list will then be presented and distributed by supervisors at their ",
      "unit meetings. For new and transfer staff to our county, the Community Partner Resource List ",
      "will be a part of their orientation. It will be given to them by their supervisor along with any ",
      "applicable training and working knowledge of specific services in the community ",
      "Engagement with Local Service or Resource Organizations ",
      "Various engagement activities with local service or resource organizations will occur in order to ",
      "learn more about the resources available. These activities will include the following: An Annual ",
      "Services Provider Fair, Provider\u2019s invited to staff meeting for presentations of new programs, ",
      "information and resources. Provider driven trainings is specific service areas. The Community ",
      "Resource Coordinator, with support from the supervisors, will keep track of all provider ",
      "engagement activities and who was in attendance to ensure that all engagement activities are ",
      "completed each year. Any activities that qualify as training will be tracked and shared with the ",
      "Van Buren DHHS Training Coordinator"
